### QUESTION : KAUNSA LB USE KARNA HAI — L4 YA L7? KAISE DECIDE KAREIN?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------


                        Traffic ka type kya hai?
                                |
                ┌───────────────┴───────────────┐
                v                               v
        Non-HTTP (raw TCP/UDP)           HTTP / HTTPS
        (MySQL, Redis, Kafka,            (REST APIs,
         custom binary protocol)          web traffic)
                |                               |
                v                               v
