                            → L7 (SSL Termination)



#### IMPORTANT : PRODUCTION ME TYPICALLY DONO HOTE HAIN
---------------------------------------------------------

Real production architectures me aksar L4 aur L7 dono use hote hain,
ek ke baad ek:

    Internet
       |
       v
    L4 LB     ← DDoS protection, raw performance
       |
       v
    L7 LB     ← URL routing, SSL Termination, WAF
       |
       v
    Backend Services

    - L4 first layer me  → High throughput, DDoS mitigation
    - L7 second layer me → Content routing, SSL Termination




