### QUESTION : LB KHUD FAIL HO GAYA TO KYA HOGA? — HIGH AVAILABILITY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

LB khud ek critical component hai. Agar LB fail ho gaya, to saara
traffic ruk jaayega — chahe backend servers healthy hon.

Isliye production me LB ko Highly Available banate hain.


### APPROACH 1 : ACTIVE-PASSIVE
--------------------------------

Do LB instances hote hain:

    - Ek Active    → saara traffic handle karta hai
    - Ek Passive   → standby, sirf Active fail hone par active hota hai

Client ko ek Virtual IP (VIP) dikhti hai — actual LB ka IP nahi.
VIP ek shared/floating IP hai jo ek time par sirf ek LB ke paas hoti hai.


#### NORMAL STATE :
---------------------

                    Client
                      |
                      |  DNS: myapp.com → 1.2.3.4 (VIP)
                      v
                ┌───────────┐
                │  VIP      │
                │  1.2.3.4  │
                └─────┬─────┘
                      |
              ┌───────┴───────┐
              v               v
      ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
      │  Active LB   │  │  Passive LB  │
      │  Real IP:    │  │  Real IP:    │
      │  10.0.0.10   │  │  10.0.0.11   │
      │  (VIP hold)  │  │  (no VIP)    │
      └──────┬───────┘  └──────────────┘
             |
             v
      ┌──────────────┐
      │   Backend    │
      │   Servers    │
      └──────────────┘


#### ACTIVE FAIL HONE PAR :
-----------------------------

Active LB fail hone par VIP Passive LB ko mil jaati hai,
aur wahi naya Active ban jaata hai — Client ko kuch pata nahi chalta.
Ye failover VRRP jaise protocols se kuch seconds me automatically hota hai.



### APPROACH 2 : ACTIVE-ACTIVE
------------------------------

Dono LB instances active hote hain, aur traffic ko DNS Round Robin ya
Anycast ke through distribute hota hai.

                    Client
                      |
                      |  DNS: myapp.com → multiple IPs
                      v
              ┌───────┴───────┐
              v               v
      ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
      │   LB-1       │  │   LB-2       │
      │   (Active)   │  │   (Active)   │
      └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘
             |                 |
             └────────┬────────┘
                      v
              ┌──────────────┐
              │   Backend    │
              │   Servers    │
              └──────────────┘

Agar ek LB fail ho gaya, doosra automatically saara traffic sambhal
leta hai — Client ko kuch pata nahi chalta (failover instantaneous,
kyunki dono already running hain).

Use case: Modern cloud, high-scale systems.












