## QUESTION : KYA EK SINGLE API GATEWAY KAAFI HAI ?
----------------------------------------------------

Conceptually ek API Gateway kaafi hai — small / low-traffic
systems ke liye valid hai.

                    DNS
                     |
                     v
               API Gateway
                     |
      ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
      v              v              v
  User Svc LB    Order Svc LB    Payment Svc LB



Lekin production me ye SPOF ban jaata hai. Agar wo down
ho gaya, to saari client requests fail ho jaayengi (chahe backend
services healthy hon).

Isliye production me multiple API Gateway instances deploy kiye
jaate hain, aur unke aage ek Load Balancer rakha jaata hai.

LB generally L4 hota hai — kyunki API Gateway khud L7 hai (URL
routing, SSL Termination etc  wo handle karta hai). LB ka
kaam bas instances ke beech traffic distribute karna hai.

Lekin ek caveat hai:

    - Traditional L4 LB → Sirf TCP-level health check karta hai.
                          Agar API Gateway andar se hang hai but
                          port open hai, to L4 usse healthy maan
                          lega.

    - Modern L4 LB (AWS NLB) → HTTP health checks support karta hai
                                — isliye health check ka ye problem
                                solve ho jaata hai.



### PRODUCTION ARCHITECTURE
-----------------------------

               User
                 |
                 v
                DNS
                 |
                 | returns Load Balancer IP
                 v
    ┌──────────────────────────┐
    │      Load Balancer       │
    └────────────┬─────────────┘
                 |
      ┌──────────┼──────────┐
      v          v          v
  ┌────────┐ ┌────────┐ ┌────────┐
  │ API GW │ │ API GW │ │ API GW │
  │   1    │ │   2    │ │   3    │
  └───┬────┘ └───┬────┘ └───┬────┘
      |          |          |
      └──────────┼──────────┘
                 |
      ┌──────────┼──────────┐
      v          v          v
  User Svc LB  Order Svc LB  Payment Svc LB
      |          |          |
      v          v          v
  User       Order       Payment
  Instances  Instances   Instances


Load Balancer incoming requests ko multiple API Gateway instances
ke beech distribute karta hai. Agar koi ek Gateway fail ho jaaye,
to LB baaki healthy instances ko traffic bhej deta hai.

Benefits:

    - High Availability
    - Horizontal Scalability
    - No Single Point of Failure



