## QUESTION : API GATEWAY KAB UNNECESSARY HOTA HAI ?
------------------------------------------------------

1. MONOLITHIC ARCHITECTURE
----------------------------

   Isme sirf ek hi service hoti hai (multiple instances ke saath),
   aur URL routing application ke andar hoti hai (Spring Boot
   controllers). API Gateway ka koi kaam nahi bachta — kyunki
   route karne ke liye multiple services hi nahi hain.

   Is case me L7 LB kaafi hai — instances ke beech traffic
   distribute karne, health checks, SSL Termination, aur
   rate limiting ke liye.

   LEKIN agar API versioning, authentication/authorization jaise
   advanced features chahiye, to API Gateway ki zaroorat pad
   sakti hai.


2. MICROSERVICES + L7 LB (bina advanced features ki zaroorat)
---------------------------------------------------------------

   L7 LB khud URL routing, rate limiting, request/response
   transformation, health checks, aur SSL Termination kar sakta
   hai.

   Agar authentication, API versioning jaise cross-cutting
   concerns ki zaroorat nahi — to L7 LB hi kaafi hai.
   Dedicated API Gateway unnecessary hai yahan.




