## QUESTION : SERVICE DISCOVERY KYA HAI ?
===========================================

Service Discovery ek central registry hai jisme har service ke
healthy instances ka IP:Port register hota hai.

Har service instance start hote hi registry me apna naam
register karta hai. Crash / shutdown par deregister ho jaata hai.


### QUESTION : SERVICE DISCOVERY KI ZAROORAT KYUN PADTI HAI ?
--------------------------------------------------------------

Production systems me services cloud par run karti hain, aur unke
multiple instances dynamically aate-jaate rehte hain — naya instance
add hua, purana kill ho gaya, ya koi crash ho gaya.

Isliye har instance ko locate karna mushkil ho jaata hai — kyunki
IP aur Port change hote rehte hain, aur manually unhe maintain
karna impractical hai.

Is problem ko solve karne ke liye Service Discovery use hoti
hai.


### QUESTION : KAHAN USE HOTA HAI ?
-------------------------------------

1. SERVICE LB → Registry se query karke current healthy instances
   ki list nikaalta hai, aur unme traffic distribute karta hai.

2. API GATEWAY (agar usme LB capability ho) → URL routing ke baad
   Service Discovery se healthy instances ka pata laga kar unme
   traffic distribute kar sakta hai.


### NOTE:
----------

Service-to-service HTTPS REST API calls bhi eventually
target service ke LB ke through hi jaati hain — to Service
Discovery wahan bhi indirectly use hoti hai.

Calling service ko sirf target service ke LB ka URL pata hona
chahiye (jaise order-service.company.com).


EXAMPLES:

    - Eureka (Netflix)
    - Consul (HashiCorp)
    - etcd



